(property "Description" "Commercial board, physical terminals qualified by connector. Factory RT9193-33, RF bias network, MS621FE and decoupling remain on module. | module | Supply VCC with Q6A 5V; do not feed it from 3V3. Leave module SDA/SCL disconnected from I2C2.; P1.6 RESET connects via factory 0 ohm to LC76G RESET_N. Use the external 2N7002 open drain, high at its gate to reset.; Quectel specifies an internal 10k pullup to 1.8V on RESET_N and forbids external pullups. Hold reset low for at least 100ms, then release." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
